  "title": "ISic000645. Epitaph for the doctor Montanos",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: <a href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/532NF7SV\">https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/532NF7SV</a></div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <br id=\"al1\"><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br id=\"al1-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>ἐνθάδε τίς <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Μον\n                    τανὸς\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Μον\n                    τανὸς\">Μον-<br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>τανὸς</span></span> ἰητὴρ ἤδε γε-<br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>ωργὸς <span dir=\"ltr\">(vac.1)</span>  <br id=\"al2\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ὀκτω χ εἰκ[ο-]<br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>σ̣έ̣της κεῖτο μινυνθά-<br id=\"al5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>διος <span dir=\"ltr\">(vac.1)</span>  <br id=\"al3\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>κουριδίην ἄλο-<br id=\"al6-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>χον προλιπὼν καὶ νή̣-<br id=\"al7-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7</span>πια τέκνα <br id=\"al4\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>καὶ γε-<br id=\"al8-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">8</span>νέτας ὀλοφυρο-<br id=\"al9-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">9</span>μένους πολιάς τε <br id=\"al10-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">10</span>ἐθείρας <br id=\"al5\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>δρυπτο-<br id=\"al11-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">11</span>μένους ὅτι οἱ νεο-<br id=\"al12-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">12</span>θηλέα καλὰ γένι-<br id=\"al13-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">13</span>α <span dir=\"ltr\">(vac.1)</span>  <br id=\"al6\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>θυμὸν ἀπο-<br id=\"al14-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">14</span>πνείοντος ἐκεί-<br id=\"al15-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">15</span>ροσαν ἐν δακρύ-<br id=\"al16-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">16</span>οισιν <span dir=\"ltr\">(vac.1)</span>  <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Μοντα\n                    νὸς\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Μοντα\n                    νὸς\">Μοντα-<br id=\"al17-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">17</span>νὸς</span></span> εὐσεβίῃ πα<a id=\"al18-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">18</span>τὴρ ἐποίησεν <span dir=\"ltr\">(vac.1)</span>  <br id=\"al19-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">19</span>❦ ❦ </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: <a href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/532NF7SV\">https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/532NF7SV</a></div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><br id=\"al1\"><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>ΕΝΘΑΔΕΤΙΣ<span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Μον\n                    τανὸς\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Μον\n                    τανὸς\">ΜΟΝ<br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>ΤΑΝΟΣ</span></span>ΙΗΤΗΡΗΔΕΓΕ<br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>ΩΡΓΟΣ&nbsp;&nbsp; <br id=\"al2\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ΟΚΤΩΧΕΙΚ[.]<br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>..ΤΗΣΚΕΙΤΟΜΙΝΥΝΘΑ<br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>ΔΙΟΣ&nbsp;&nbsp; <br id=\"al3\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>ΚΟΥΡΙΔΙΗΝΑΛΟ<br id=\"al6-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>ΧΟΝΠΡΟΛΙΠΩΝΚΑΙΝ.<br id=\"al7-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7</span>ΠΙΑΤΕΚΝΑ<br id=\"al4\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>ΚΑΙΓΕ<br id=\"al8-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">8</span>ΝΕΤΑΣΟΛΟΦΥΡΟ<br id=\"al9-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">9</span>ΜΕΝΟΥΣΠΟΛΙΑΣΤΕ<br id=\"al10-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">10</span>ΕΘΕΙΡΑΣ<br id=\"al5\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>ΔΡΥΠΤΟ<br id=\"al11-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">11</span>ΜΕΝΟΥΣΟΤΙΟΙΝΕΟ<br id=\"al12-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">12</span>ΘΗΛΕΑΚΑΛΑΓΕΝΙ<br id=\"al13-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">13</span>Α&nbsp;&nbsp; <br id=\"al6\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>ΘΥΜΟΝΑΠΟ<br id=\"al14-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">14</span>ΠΝΕΙΟΝΤΟΣΕΚΕΙ<br id=\"al15-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">15</span>ΡΟΣΑΝΕΝΔΑΚΡΥ<br id=\"al16-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">16</span>ΟΙΣΙΝ&nbsp;&nbsp; <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Μοντα\n                    νὸς\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Μοντα\n                    νὸς\">ΜΟΝΤΑ<br id=\"al17-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">17</span>ΝΟΣ</span></span>ΕΥΣΕΒΙΗΠΑ<a id=\"al18-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">18</span>ΤΗΡΕΠΟΙΗΣΕΝ&nbsp;&nbsp; <br id=\"al19-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">19</span>❦❦</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span><span>Text of Manganaro 1994</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>Italian translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\">  </p><p>Qui chi (e')? Montano medico e agricoltore ventottenne giacque giovane, la legittima sposa lasciando anzitempo e piccoli figli e i genitori in lamento, che si strappano i canuti capelli, per il fatto che a lui la barba bella cresciuta da poco, di lui che spirava l'anima, tagliarono tra le lacrime. Montano il padre per pieta' ha fatto (la tomba) [trans. G. Manganaro]</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>  </p></div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> 1994.0768 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283</a></li><li> 46.1269 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796</a></li><li> 44.0779 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796</a></li><li> 1995.0029 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001282\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001282</a></li><li> 1995.0689 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001282\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001282</a></li><li> Manganaro 1988 63 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427</a></li><li> Manganaro 1994 105-107 no.19 fig.25 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001825\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001825</a></li><li> Manganaro 1996 80-81 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001480\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001480</a></li><li> Cassia 2009-2012 168 no.19 </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"><p>Lunate sigma and epsilon; alpha, mu, delta and lamda with extended upper strokes; uncial omega</p> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  </div>",
